# Objective

What are we trying to accomplish?

# Current state

What is implemented/investigated? Observed at <UTC timestamp>. Task is <in progress / blocked / complete>.

# Important decisions

Decisions to preserve and their reasons. Cite canonical artifacts rather than copying specs.

# Changed files

Repository-relative paths, with their relevant role.

# Git state

Observed branch, HEAD, relevant commits, staged/unstaged/untracked status. No raw diff or credential-bearing remote URLs.

# Verification

Exact commands, outcomes, and scope. Distinguish tested results from planned checks.

# Current failures/blockers

Known failing tests/errors, missing access, and unresolved human decisions; write none when applicable.

# Constraints / Do not

Scope boundaries and things the next agent must preserve.

# External references

Issue/spec/ADR/doc paths or public URLs without credentials. Earlier memory IDs and explicit follow-up/correction relationships.

# Next exact action

One concrete step, grounded in the current repository and user authorization.

# Potential follow-up

What likely comes immediately afterward.

# Suggested skills

Relevant skill names; no full skill bodies.
